OL,3,GNEWSAMet assesses BBC's findings on    
OL,4,Apredatory detective                    
OL,6,FWarning: Contains details of violence, 
OL,7,Fcoercion and sexual abuse              
OL,9,FThe head of the Metropolitan Police    
OL,10,Fsays the force is reviewing the        
OL,11,Ffindings of a BBC Panorama             
OL,12,Finvestigation into a predatory         
OL,13,Fdetective who sexually exploited women 
OL,14,Fwhose cases he investigated.           
OL,16,FOn Tuesday, the BBC revealed that the  
OL,17,Fforce repeatedly missed opportunities  
OL,18,Fto stop Det Insp Warren Arter's        
OL,19,Fexploitation of domestic and sexual    
OL,20,Fabuse victims.                         
