OL,6,FThe former lead of a unit investigating
OL,7,Frape cases in south-east London groomed
OL,8,Fwomen it was his job to protect,       
OL,9,Fincluding one who he married and then  
OL,10,Fsubjected to 15 years of domestic and  
OL,11,Fsexual abuse.                          
